          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "adolescence is a learned borrowing from Latin adulēscentia \"youth\" (EtymDB), from adolēscere \"to grow up\", built on alere \"to nourish\" (Lewis & Short)."
            }
          ]
        },
